OL,4,CBBC Radio 1's Big Weekend 2027 heads   
OL,5,Cto Brighton                            
OL,6,GBBC Radio 1's Big Weekend is heading   
OL,7,Gto Brighton for 2027, it has been      
OL,8,Gannounced.                             
OL,10,FThe annual music festival will take    
OL,11,Fplace in Preston Park from Friday 28   
OL,12,Fto Sunday 30 May next year.            
OL,14,FRadio 1 Breakfast Show host Greg James 
OL,15,Ftold listeners he is "so excited" to   
OL,16,Fbring the festival to the city as he   
OL,17,Frevealed the news on air, adding:      
OL,18,F"It's going to be amazing".            
